IGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">지 급 액</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 310.62pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 60.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 한국방송통신대학교 학생 학기당 35만 원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 전문대학, 산업대학 학생 학기당 100만 원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 4년제 대학(원)생 학기당 150만 원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">※ 등록금 범위 내에서 중복수혜 가능</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 92.71pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 60.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">결격사유가 없는</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">한 <strong>2년간 지급</strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(전문대학, 산업대학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> <strong>1년간 지급</strong>)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 78.56pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 66.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">선발 장학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">의무사항</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 310.62pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 66.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 매 학기 성적증명서 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 매 학기 기준 성적 유지 : 평균 80점(대학원 89점)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">○ 장학생 기록카드 제출</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 92.71pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 66.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">의무사항 미 이행 시 장학금 지급 중단</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 제출서류</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 장학생 지원신청서 및 추천서 (본원 소정양식 -붙임파일 다운로드)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 개인정보제공동의서(본원 소정양식 -붙임파일 다운로드)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 2학기 성적증명서 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 장애인복지카드 사본이나 장애인임을 증명할 수 있는 서류 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">가족관계증명서 사본 1부(미혼:부모명의 가족관계증명서, 기혼:본인명의 가족관계증명서)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">바. 가정형편을 증명할 수 있는 국민기초생활보장수급자, 차상위계층증명서(해당자) 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">사.</span> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">지방세세목별과세증명서(미혼:본인 및 부모명의, 기혼:본인 및 배우자 명의 증명서 각1부) 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">아.</span> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">건강장기요양보험료 납부확인서 1부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(미혼:본인 또는 부모명의, 기혼 : 본인 또는 배우자)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">자. 각종대회 입상 등 국가기술자격증명서 사본 1부(예.체능 및 정보통신 특기장학생)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 장학생 선정방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">성적, 소득수준 등을 합산, 지원자 상대평가 후 선발</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 신청방법 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">상기 제출서류를 구비하여 재학하고 있는 학교의 장학담당 부서를 통하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">학교장 명의에 의한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">정식공문으로 신청(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">개인 신청 불가)</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">□ 접수기간 및 접수처</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 1. 26.(월) ~ 2015. 2. 4.(수)(도착분까지 유효)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 신청서교부 : 본원 내방 또는 본원 홈페이지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(<a href=\"http://www.koddi.or.kr)/\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">www.koddi.or.kr)</font></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">에서 다운로드</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">홈페이지 - 공지사항 - 2015년 쌍용곰두리장학생 선발공고 - 첨부파일 참조 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 접수 방법 : 우편접수 또는 방문(팩스 및 인터넷 접수 불가)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 신청서접수 : 한국장애인개발원 대외협력팀(장학담당, 02- 3433- 0642)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(150-917) 서울 영등포구 의사당로 22 이룸센터 5층</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
